==English==

===Alternative forms===
This expression is frequently seen as
* '''pulling teeth'''
* '''like pulling teeth'''

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|En-au-pull teeth.ogg|Audio (AU)}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|pulls teeth|pulling teeth|pulled teeth}}

# {{lb|en|dentistry}} To remove teeth, usually because they are diseased or damaged.
# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} To do something that is especially [[difficult]] or [[effortful]].
#: {{syn|en|get blood out of a stone}}
#: {{ux|en|You will probably have to '''pull teeth''' to get a straight answer from a car salesman.}}

